  "description": "Brunel is located in Uxbridge, West London, and is ranked as one of the top 400 universities in the world by QS World University Rankings 2021 and the Times Higher Education World University Rankings 2021. Traditionally the university's strengths are in engineering, science, technology and social sciences, and Brunel students have access to specialist laboratories for electronic imaging, bioprocessing and experimental techniques; flight, driving and train simulators; a 3-D body scanner; an MRI scanner; motion-capture equipment; and an occupational therapy suite. The International College offers world-class pathway programs leading to undergraduate and postgraduate degrees at Brunel University and is located inside Brunel University London Campus. Timestamps",
